<rss version="0.92"><channel><item>
            <title>[LU-20691] Allow hsm coordinator to move timedout restores to ARS_WAITING</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20691</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Allow hsm coordinator to move timedout restores to ARS_WAITING. Today all these requests are marked as failed. We should be able to re-use the same mechanism as intentional retry since those do get reassigned. &lt;br/&gt;
It need not be default behavior, can be enabled/disabled via policy flags.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment />
