                            <comment id="500916" author="JIRAUSER19549" created="Thu, 3 Sep 2026 17:33:16 +0000">&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=adilger" class="user-hover" rel="adilger"&gt;adilger&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=adegremont_nvda" class="user-hover" rel="adegremont_nvda"&gt;adegremont_nvda&lt;/a&gt; &lt;br/&gt;
let me know what you guys think about this. I haven't looked at the implementation bits yet but is this something Lustre should support. &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="500998" author="adilger" created="Sat, 5 Sep 2026 04:56:47 +0000">&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=praveen.solanki" class="user-hover" rel="praveen.solanki"&gt;praveen.solanki&lt;/a&gt;, I'm probably not the best person to ask about HSM features, better to discuss with some of the other HSM developers (CC'd).&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="501221" author="JIRAUSER18483" created="Mon, 7 Sep 2026 15:52:52 +0000">&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=praveen.solanki" class="user-hover" rel="praveen.solanki"&gt;praveen.solanki&lt;/a&gt; have you considered turning the Retry Policy on?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="code panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="codeContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre class="code-java"&gt;
$ lctl set_param mdt.$FSNAME-MDT*.hsm.policy=-NRA&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;See &lt;a href="https://doc.lustre.org/lustre_manual.xhtml#hsmpolicy" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://doc.lustre.org/lustre_manual.xhtml#hsmpolicy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
